### 12. Expected Outcome

At the end of the project, LegalEase should provide a functional web-based platform where users can enter relevant information and generate structured drafts of selected legal documents. The system should make basic document drafting more accessible while clearly communicating that generated documents may require review by a qualified legal professional.
